{"time_ns": 1792762021700066048, "kind": "result", "action_index": 9, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "96dacc034340aa7ce80a640f70a4848648015cd4e6e6ee0f9c847bebc7781fc9", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Summary\n\nThis report summarizes the regional distribution of transaction amounts from the records database.\n\n## Data Overview\n\n- **Total Records Processed**: 18\n- **Total Amount**: 794,823 cents ($7,948.23)\n\n## Breakdown by Region\n\n| Region | Count | Total (cents) | Total ($) |\n|--------|-------|---------------|-----------|\n| North  | 6     | 332,203       | $3,322.03 |\n| South  | 6     | 215,012       | $2,150.12 |\n| West   | 6     | 247,608       | $2,476.08 |\n\n## Records by Region\n\n**North (6 records)**: R004, R007, R010, R016, R019, R022\n- Total: 332,203 cents\n\n**South (6 records)**: R002, R008, R011, R014, R020, R023\n- Total: 215,012 cents\n\n**West (6 records)**: R003, R006, R012, R015, R018, R024\n- Total: 247,608 cents\n\n## Conclusion\n\nThe data shows an even distribution of 6 records across three regions. The North region has the highest total at $3,322.03, followed by West at $2,476.08, and South at $2,150.12.\n", "ok": true}
